WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.750
Have you ever wondered what the quiet, studious
Dr. Trebuchet wants more than anything in

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.750
the world?

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:11.530
Foundation researchers used SCP-978, The Desire
Camera, to snap a photo of Dr. Trebuchet passed

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:15.969
out at her desk after 89 straight hours of
transcribing interview logs.

00:00:15.969 --> 00:00:21.510
A small puddle of drool was forming under
her head, soaking the papers there.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.580
This was the result:

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.330
"Still transcribing interview logs."

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:29.940
It seems that there is only one thing that
Dr. Trebuchet really wants in this world:

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.100
to do her job.

